  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhance stability and social cohesion in Egypt through Building Resilience and Providing Sustainable Livelihoods Amongst</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing economic stability and social cohesion between refugees and host communities in Egypt to promote long term conflict prevention and local peace building&#xC800;&#xC18C;&#xB4DD; &#xC9C0;&#xC5ED; &#xB0B4; &#xB09C;&#xBBFC;&#xACFC; &#xC218;&#xC6A9; &#xACF5;&#xB3D9;&#xCCB4; &#xAC04; &#xC0AC;&#xD68C;&#xC801; &#xD1B5;&#xD569; &#xBC0F; &#xC0DD;&#xACC4; &#xAC1C;&#xC120;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vocational training on highly marketable skills and qualifications, entrepreneurship promotion, group and individual psychosocial support sessions, regular health/nutrition monitoring visits, culinary training for refugee mothers and the host community</narrative>
  </description>
